# A11y & Performance

## A11y
- Keyboard navigation, focus outlines, aria labels. Use Radix primitives correctly.
- Color contrast ≥ WCAG AA. Provide `aria-live` for form errors/toasts.

## Performance
- Prefer RSC for heavy, static blocks. Dynamic import for low-priority client widgets.
- Optimize images (next/image) and preload fonts. Avoid blocking synchronous scripts.
